Adds an item to the queue. If the queue is full, the item is rejected and onReject is called.\nItems can be inserted based on priority or at the front/back depending on configuration.\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"},{"type":"text","value":" cannot be queued (it is the internal \"no item\" sentinel) and is always rejected."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"item","children":[{"type":"text","value":"item"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TValue"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"position","children":[{"type":"text","value":"position?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueuePosition"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"runonitemschange","children":[{"type":"text","value":"runOnItemsChange?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"queuer.addItem({ value: 'task', priority: 10 });\nqueuer.addItem('task2', 'front');","lang":"ts"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"queuer","children":[{"type":"text","value":"queuer"}]},{"type":"code","value":"queuer: AngularAsyncQueuer<TValue, TSelected>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuedSignal.ts#L13","children":[{"type":"text","value":"async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuedSignal.ts:13"}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tvalue","text":"TValue","level":3},{"id":"tselected","text":"TSelected","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"additem","text":"addItem","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"item","text":"item","level":5},{"id":"position","text":"position?","level":5},{"id":"runonitemschange","text":"runOnItemsChange?","level":5},{"id":"returns-2","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":4},{"id":"queuer","text":"queuer","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuedSignal.ts:10](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuedSignal.ts#L10)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue`\n\n### TSelected\n\n`TSelected` = \\{\n\\}\n\n```ts\nAsyncQueuedSignal(): TValue[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuedSignal.ts:11](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuedSignal.ts#L11)\n\n## Returns\n\n`TValue`[]\n\n## Properties\n\n### addItem\n\n```ts\naddItem: (item, position?, runOnItemsChange?) => boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuedSignal.ts:12](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuedSignal.ts#L12)\n\nAdds an item to the queue. If the queue is full, the item is rejected and onReject is called.\nItems can be inserted based on priority or at the front/back depending on configuration.\n`undefined` cannot be queued (it is the internal \"no item\" sentinel) and is always rejected.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### item\n\n`TValue`\n\n##### position?\n\n`QueuePosition`\n\n##### runOnItemsChange?\n\n`boolean`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\nqueuer.addItem({ value: 'task', priority: 10 });\nqueuer.addItem('task2', 'front');\n```\n\n***\n\n### queuer\n\n```ts\nqueuer: AngularAsyncQueuer<TValue, TSelected>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuedSignal.ts:13](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuedSignal.ts#L13)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: AsyncQueuedSignal\ntitle: AsyncQueuedSignal\n---\n\nDefined in: [async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuedSignal.ts:10](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuedSignal.ts#L10)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue`\n\n### TSelected\n\n`TSelected` = \\{\n\\}\n\n```ts\nAsyncQueuedSignal(): TValue[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuedSignal.ts:11](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuedSignal.ts#L11)\n\n## Returns\n\n`TValue`[]\n\n## Properties\n\n### addItem\n\n```ts\naddItem: (item, position?, runOnItemsChange?) => boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuedSignal.ts:12](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuedSignal.ts#L12)\n\nAdds an item to the queue. If the queue is full, the item is rejected and onReject is called.\nItems can be inserted based on priority or at the front/back depending on configuration.\n`undefined` cannot be queued (it is the internal \"no item\" sentinel) and is always rejected.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### item\n\n`TValue`\n\n##### position?\n\n`QueuePosition`\n\n##### runOnItemsChange?\n\n`boolean`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\nqueuer.addItem({ value: 'task', priority: 10 });\nqueuer.addItem('task2', 'front');\n```\n\n***\n\n### queuer\n\n```ts\nqueuer: AngularAsyncQueuer<TValue, TSelected>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuedSignal.ts:13](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/async-queuer/injectAsyncQueuedSignal.ts#L13)\n"}
